# BentoGallery - a tiling gallery on a fixed row-height grid, so cells of different column widths always line up.
# Each BentoCell picks its own col-span (and bg / content) via class:
#   BentoGallery {
#     BentoCell class("col-span-4 bg-muted") { Span "01" }
#     BentoCell class("col-span-2 bg-accent") { Span "02" }
#   }
# shadcn-for-muten · block · no deps · uses .bento-gallery / .bento-cell from globals.css.
part BentoGallery() { Stack class("bento-gallery") { slot } }
part BentoCell() { Stack class("bento-cell") { slot } }
